     "@en": "**Quanto** is in line with the name **quanti libri?** (masculine plural), **quante stanze?** (feminine plural)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Algunos adjetivos muy usados suelen ir delante del nombre: **nuovo**, **bello**, **piccolo**, **grande**. Pero los colores van siempre detrás.",
     "@en": "Some highly used adjectives usually go before the name: **nuovo**, **bello**, **piccolo**, **grande**. But the colors are always behind."
